/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 168.3899999999999864 Td
(When isolated regionally, the statistics reflect a structural crisis. Northern Nigeria accounts for over) Tj
T* (60% of the country's out-of-school children, with the North-East recording an out-of-school rate of) Tj
T* (roughly 33%. Furthermore, UNICEF's MICS evaluation indicates that only 18% of adolescent girls in) Tj
T* (the region own a mobile phone, drastically limiting informal digital learning opportunities.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.439 0.439 0.51 rg
70. 96.3899999999999864 Td
(When over 90% of your youth population lacks basic tech competency, you do not have a) Tj
T* (temporary skill gap. You have systemic digital disenfranchisement.) Tj
