(When regional schools fail to cultivate digital talent, local tech ventures and corporate entities are) Tj
T* (forced to source software engineers, data analysts, and network specialists from outside the region) Tj
T* (or abroad. This dynamic drives capital flight away from the North and deepens local economic) Tj
T* (stagnation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 682.8899999999999864 Td
(Moreover, in a region with a rapidly growing youth demographic, failing to provide market-relevant) Tj
T* (technical education creates widespread unemployability. As Khalifa noted, a vast population of idled) Tj
T* (youth lacking 21st-century economic opportunities creates fertile ground for social) Tj
T* (disenfranchisement and civil instability. Resolving the tech education crisis is, therefore, a core) Tj
T* (national security imperative.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0.486 0.361 0.941 rg
56. 581.3899999999999864 Td
(NextWave Infotech's Framework for Reform) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 555.3899999999999864 Td
(Addressing a structural crisis of this magnitude requires moving beyond cosmetic fixes, such as) Tj
T* (sporadic desktop computer donations. Khalifa and the leadership team at NextWave Infotech) Tj
T* (advocate for a targeted three-point structural overhaul of technology instruction across the North:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
70. 499.8899999999999864 Td
(1. Mandate practical evaluation: Examination standards must be overhauled. Students should no) Tj
T* (longer pass computer studies by writing theoretical essays; at least 70% of assessment grades) Tj
T* (must be based on practical performance on live software systems.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
70. 444.3899999999999864 Td
(2. Institutionalize teacher upskilling: Establish mandatory, continuous digital certification) Tj
T* (bootcamps for primary and secondary educators before they enter the classroom.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
70. 405.3899999999999864 Td
(3. Build public-private pipelines: State education boards must form direct alliances with tech firms) Tj
T* (like NextWave Infotech to design up-to-date curricula, establish technical apprenticeships, and) Tj
T* (mentor students long before graduation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0.486 0.361 0.941 rg
56. 332.8899999999999864 Td
(Looking Ahead) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 306.8899999999999864 Td
(Northern Nigeria possesses an enormous reservoir of young, ambitious potential. However, as) Tj
T* (Muhammad Khalifa points out, raw talent without honest, practical education cannot drive economic) Tj
T* (development.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 251.3899999999999864 Td
(If Northern Nigeria is to participate meaningfully in the global tech ecosystem, policymakers,) Tj
T* (educators, and industry leaders must confront the present reality with candor and take immediate,) Tj
T* (structural action to rebuild tech education from the ground up.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.11 0.11 0.149 rg
56. 195.8899999999999864 Td
(To gain further context on the national digital literacy gap referenced by Muhammad Khalifa, watch) Tj
T* (this report detailing official UNICEF MICS findings: UNICEF Report Reveals Only 7% of Nigerian) Tj
T* (Youth Have ICT Skills \(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8qrURwoP9_c\).) Tj
